Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:03.43,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Okay, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:06.75,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,I'm Yamada Kento! I wanna be a ladies' man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.41,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,But I'll be faithful once \NI have a girlfriend, so hit me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.93,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.87,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Next up is, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:17.40,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.28,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,To battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:55.90,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Self-intros?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.55,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nothing serious, I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll just keep things casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:02.56,DefaultItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,That explains the lack of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:06.11,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Smile, okay? Just smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:09.94,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Nobody's gonna \Nask you to tell a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:11.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shmiwe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:12.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.34,Default,JK1,0,0,0,,Is that a dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.22,Default,JK2,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:21.80,Default,JK1,0,0,0,,But hey, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:28.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is this better?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:33.95,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Gosh, I can't even tell the difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.80,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,But you're cute either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:36.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.29,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice, Nao-chan. {/int}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:44.89,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm Iwakura Mitsumi. \NMy birthday is March 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I came here from Ikajima, \NIshikawa Prefecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.27,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,Check out those bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:51.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's around here, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.65,DefaultTop,CLASS,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:52.65,Default,CLASS,0,0,0,,That's so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.26,Default,KOSHIBA,0,0,0,,You moved here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:56.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,No, I'm staying with a relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.19,Default,SOGA,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:03:00.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I want to be a government official, \Nwhich is why I applied to a Tokyo school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:01.96,Default,CLASS,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:02.55,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:03.70,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,Why the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:04.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:06.58,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's a bit of a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:10.57,FlashbackItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Nobody's gonna \Nask you to tell a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.20,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nao-chan, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.66,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm a woman who goes above and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:22.72,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Because I was born to lead, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:32.56,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Next up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:37.32,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I'm Shima Sousuke, born and raised in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.65,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I enjoy physical activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.20,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,My dream is, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.74,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I don't have one just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:45.66,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. I wouldn't mind \Nworking for Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:51.41,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:55.10,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He really is a great guy!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.79,0:03:59.18,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,His given name is "Sousuke," huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.80,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Written with "satoi," \Nthe kanji for "clever"... Sato...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.72,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Satonosuke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.00,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're kidding! What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.66,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,His fur's even the same color! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:16.18,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:19.45,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Next on our agenda...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:23.98,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,We need class officers, one boy and one girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:25.11,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.45,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Okay, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.46,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Nobody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.45,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Then Iwakura-san will be \Nclass officer for the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.59,Default,SUDA,0,0,0,,Then we know who the boy'll be, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.51,Default,KOSHINO,0,0,0,,Shima for the boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.13,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.17,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.27,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:53.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,We should write this on the board, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.47,0:04:54.39,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:55.81,DefaultItalics,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.22,DefaultItalics,SENBARA,0,0,0,,Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.32,DefaultItalics,NAGATA,0,0,0,,There's no way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:04.07,DefaultItalics,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Are those two, like, hitting it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:08.29,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Is Shima-kun just a natural player? \NOr is it all calculated?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.84,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Maybe I should dig into this a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:12.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:13.72,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:17.21,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,We finished our post-entrance tests, \Nso I was thinking we could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.41,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Sounds good! I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:19.68,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I wanna blow off some steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.82,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,What are the cheap places around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.24,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Karaoke... I've never been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:27.14,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! You wanna join us after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.01,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Oh, are we invited too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:31.85,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You too, Shima-kun. \NIwakura-san will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.60,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Really? Guess I'll go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:39.61,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Are all of you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:42.86,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I can go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:46.57,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Yay, I can't wait! I haven't \Ngone to karaoke in forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.75,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Murashige Yuzuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:53.58,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,I kinda didn't wanna invite \Na beauty queen like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.75,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.13,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take everything \NShima-kun says at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:05.72,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Y'know... how do I say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:10.97,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,When a guy's that hot, he's bound to \Nhave lots of girls fall for him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.18,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Uh... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:17.43,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,If he lets it get to him, \Nit causes issues with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:20.71,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,So guys like him tend to be \Nnice to everyone as a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.83,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry to spring this \Non you out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.44,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I just don't wanna see you \Nget hurt, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.33,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.95,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Right, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:37.67,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense. \NI'd let it go to my head a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:40.55,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.14,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I wish she hadn't said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.46,Default,KARAOKE,0,0,0,,How long will you be staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.59,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:51.02,Default,KARAOKE,0,0,0,,Please use the drink bar over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:52.09,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:57.06,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Two hours, so that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.78,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Iwakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:00.06,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,We pay after we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:02.35,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Is this your first time at karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:03.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There weren't any near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.82,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Some places do ask you to pay up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:11.98,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:14.21,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Don't take it at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.56,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun's nice to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.75,DefaultItalics,NARUSE,0,0,0,,You'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.75,DefaultItalicsTop,NARUSE,0,0,0,,I need you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.54,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,He's gonna join the light music club.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:26.25,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.48,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Queued up a song yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:34.71,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Are you a good singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:36.01,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:37.67,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Was that your dialect just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.52,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.52,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,My tambourine's on fire today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.15,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah. Karaoke's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:48.53,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,super loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.28,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:59.62,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Murashige-san is so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:02.09,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Doesn't this bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:07.00,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,She's clearly using you \Nto get closer to Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:10.13,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,And she's mocking your dialect, \Neven when it's easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.93,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You've picked up on it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:13.88,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.41,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I didn't have a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.73,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Let me know if you want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:22.49,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind bouncing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.27,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.64,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There were only eight people \Nin my middle-school class,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:44.71,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,so I never thought building \Nrelationships would be so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:48.09,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You can never tell what people are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.47,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Fumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:01.06,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-chan, how are ya doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:03.19,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Can't have changed in a day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:05.84,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Are ya home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:10.03,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nah, right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm at karaoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:14.31,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,What? Karaoke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:17.30,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,I've only been once, back when \NI was knee-high to a grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:19.36,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Well, this is my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:21.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm here with a bunch of people from class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.93,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Lucky you! Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:24.77,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.14,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:27.50,DefaultTop,FUMI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.12,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,That's a lie, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:30.81,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:32.47,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:34.59,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,You're kinda wishing you \Ncould go home, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.97,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Fumi... Are you a psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:41.35,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,I just know how you sound \Nwhen you're feeling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.85,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You even called at the perfect time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:48.10,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,Really? Maybe it was telepathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:55.00,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If I said, "I wish you were here with me," \Nthat'd make her worry, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:56.93,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Fumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.06,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:02.59,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Uh, how did we become friends, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:05.70,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Beats me. I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:11.28,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, but I remember not liking you \Nmuch back in kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.67,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:17.34,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,You were always pouting. \NI thought you were scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:19.50,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,But you're actually real sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:23.81,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,I just didn't know it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.22,Flashback,FUMI,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:31.00,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,And now we call each other \Nevery day. Who'da thunk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:33.64,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks, Fumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.51,Default,FUMI,0,0,0,,S'all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:38.49,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll call you back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,To vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:41.79,DefaultItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:53.75,DefaultItalicsTop,NISHINO,0,0,0,,We'll see eye-to-eye someday, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.00,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:51.93,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:53.75,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,I've been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:56.00,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Is that pin, like, a fashion statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:57.46,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.76,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wait, how am I supposed to tell? \NI've known her two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:05.92,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There's been no point \Noverthinking this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.53,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's an accessory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.86,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Oh, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.72,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:14.76,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Nice, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.27,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Go for it, Iwakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:20.53,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And Shima-kun, I'm sorry \Nfor trying to overanalyze you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:32.96,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Du-du-du-dun, march on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.96,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Tokojiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:39.48,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Where are you hauling that carrot off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:42.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hop, step, and jump, you haul it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.35,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Du-du-du-dun, come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:49.98,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Tokojiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:53.31,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Where are you hauling that carrot off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:57.75,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,When your ears droop, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.36,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san, you're so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.20,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,I loved Tokojiro as a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:08.20,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pick a nostalgic song too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:08.20,DefaultTop,NARUSE,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.15,0:12:12.24,FlashbackItalics,FUMI,0,0,0,,I just didn't know it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:15.20,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Someday...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:21.21,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Will I ever be able to laugh and reminisce \Nlike that with anyone here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.83,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That would be so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.50,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Man, I could murder a beef bowl right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.48,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.48,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,All that singing made me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.40,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:36.73,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Give me your chat ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:41.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Er... Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.78,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,See the "Add a friend" button \Nat the top of your friends list?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:48.07,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You know, I only came to play nice,\Nsince this was the first time and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:50.04,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I don't really like karaoke, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:54.15,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,But thanks to you, Mitsumi, I had fun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:00.94,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Well, I got somewhere to be, so bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:03.22,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Huh? You're leaving, Murashige-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:04.54,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.94,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You can never tell what people are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:12.56,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So I'll try to understand them, \Nlittle by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.82,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I guess we're calling it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:15.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.19,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.19,DefaultTop,ALL,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.19,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:20.92,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Shima-kun, do you watch movies and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:21.94,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sometimes, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:24.96,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet! With your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:27.45,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hmm... It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:32.45,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Egashira-san, maybe you \Nshould loosen up a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.03,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You'll have more fun that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:37.71,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:42.46,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Why would you {\i0}say{\i1} that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.72,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hey! Iwakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:50.17,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,We live in the same direction, right? \NLet's head home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:52.72,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He really does resemble Satonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:54.01,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sato-chan, do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.61,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Huh? "Sato-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:58.47,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.27,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Who are you mixing me up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:02.48,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,My family...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:03.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:06.41,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Your dog?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's just... You've got the \Nsame color fur and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.69,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:12.50,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Well, it {\i1}is{\i0} kinda wavy and soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.58,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wanna touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:23.05,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow, look at you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:32.15,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hey. Can I call you Mitsumi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:40.73,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Morning, Iwakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.56,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kinomoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.40,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:47.18,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,I found this cute little thing \Non the way home from karaoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.35,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,so I tried following your example.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.24,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,How do you like the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.45,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Cute. Very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:55.74,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Yay, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.74,0:14:58.67,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,You got a buncha recruitment flyers, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.67,0:15:03.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah. They all remembered me from my speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.58,DefaultTop,QUIZ,0,0,0,,Why don't we take over the world \Nof high-school quizzing together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:10.01,Default,SCIENCE,0,0,0,,Let's discuss the future of our environment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:13.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I keep getting invited to the brainy clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.97,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:17.00,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Have you picked your club, Kinomoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:17.77,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:19.90,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,I'll be joining the dance club!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:22.48,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.57,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Morning, Kinomoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:25.73,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You too, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:26.99,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,"Mitsumi-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:27.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.14,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,When did you get on first-name basis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:31.07,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Lucky me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:33.93,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You can call me Sato-chan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:35.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Look, that's my dog's name, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.81,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Oh my god! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.80,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Oh, morning, Egashira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:41.12,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:42.87,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Clubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:45.59,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna pass. \NI've got cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:48.75,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, you start to wonder \Nif you can juggle both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.43,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm joining the English conversation club.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:52.01,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,It'll help with exams,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.56,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,and I'm sure it'll be useful in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.56,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:02.16,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:06.51,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This is an elite prep school, \Nand I have a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:09.19,DefaultTop,SCIENCE,0,0,0,,You're the best, Mitsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:11.03,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And yet I started having \Nthese silly fantasies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:12.88,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You okay there, Mitsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:14.66,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.27,0:16:19.58,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Is this Iwakura Mitsumi-san's class?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.04,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.54,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:30.29,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,So you're the top first-year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:33.38,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,I knew it! Your eyes shine \Nlike nobody else's!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:36.36,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,I'm Kanechika, a second-year \Nand the next drama club president.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.01,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san, are you interested in acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.56,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.27,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm Iwakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.57,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,How cultured!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.99,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.25,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,I couldn't spot you hidden away like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:05.35,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,On day one, you became "The Puker."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:08.84,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,On day two, your funny self-intro \Nmade you "The Secret Boss."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:13.09,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,It's amazing that you got two \Nmonikers in such a short time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:16.59,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Here. They're today's props, but I'll let you \Nhave more, since you're so intriguing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:20.02,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks... The "Secret Boss" stuff \Nis news to me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:23.16,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,It takes talent to make \Nsuch an impression on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:25.82,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,What do you say? Theater is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:30.59,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Senpai, could you stop scaring your juniors?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:35.03,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, did I scare you? \NSorry, I got a little amped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:38.16,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Anyway, come see our performance today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.88,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,You'll be able to boast that you \Nsaw a star playwright at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.91,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,I'm talking about myself, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:49.37,DefaultItalics,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Hmm, he looks like he belongs on stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.17,DefaultItalics,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.63,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Do I know you from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.88,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,No, I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:57.38,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.75,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:02.81,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,That guy was like a hurricane, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.66,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Yeah... Talk about intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.38,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's a sin to be so gifted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:09.19,DefaultItalics,GIRLS,0,0,0,,She took him seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:25.54,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Everyone's given it serious thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:31.84,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'd better pull myself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:34.18,Default,TT,0,0,0,,Everyone gather up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.18,Default,TT,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.97,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Yikes, not many first-years, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:44.35,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:45.26,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:48.95,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,They don't have enough people \Nfor the female parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:51.62,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,so Kanechika's been running around in heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.45,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.02,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:07.87,Default,BOY,0,0,0,,You're the one who left that night!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.19,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.85,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,You said solitude was the only way \Nto keep a safe distance from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:15.59,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,That's a wild assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:19.66,DefaultTop,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,You think? Then why didn't you \Nreply to my letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:19.66,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It was a conversational play \Ninvolving four characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:23.83,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Most of it flew over my head, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:26.85,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But I felt like the most exciting \Ndiscoveries and achievements
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:32.27,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,are usually a product of the kind of single-\Nminded dedication I saw on that stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:47.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You came to watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.91,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:51.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wasn't expecting you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:52.77,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:58.57,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is he \Nnot as talkative as usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:03.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What do you do when you're having \Na hard time making up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:04.54,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Is this about clubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:06.80,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Is it bothering you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.56,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:17.57,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I tell myself that the things I'm undecided on \Nwere never that important anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:22.44,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,There are only so many important things \Nyou can't compromise on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.71,0:20:25.57,FlashbackItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,It's just the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:31.33,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun is light-hearted, always smiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.08,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:37.84,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Anyway, Mitsumi-chan, \NI kinda need to hurry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:44.60,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But sometimes, he seems a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:49.49,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,A total mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:54.32,Default,TANAKA,0,0,0,,Wanna grab something on the way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:56.31,Default,SUDA,0,0,0,,I'm down for some fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.31,DefaultTop,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:59.69,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.19,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,You're Kanade-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.45,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Are you confusing me with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.38,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.05,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry, go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:09.87,Default,SUDA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:11.73,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Listen, I know I'm right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:14.30,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,My father loved that TV show!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.23,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,He recorded all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:18.50,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,I only watched it in middle school—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.59,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Kanematsu-senpai, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.49,0:21:24.59,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Don't you understand? \NI don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.11,0:21:29.57,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,It's amazing you call yourself a playwright \Nwhen you can't even pick up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:31.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.93,Default,KANECHIKA,0,0,0,,Ohh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.48,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nao-chan, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I've decided not to join any clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.84,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:49.37,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:51.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm going to join the student council!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:55.12,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It'll help me get some \Nvaluable leadership experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:58.38,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Ah, youth! Ah, high schoolers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.38,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Always with the big, starry-eyed dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:01.31,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.31,0:22:03.85,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay like this \Nall the way to retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.85,0:22:05.80,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, this rolly thingie feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.41,0:22:07.56,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Doesn't it?

